    excerpt: "The case for and against using AI to answer the Questions and Answers section on a contractor's Google Business Profile.",
    metaDescription: "Should contractors use AI to answer Google Business Profile questions? Here's when it helps, when it risks trust, and how to do it responsibly.",
    category: "Tools & Technology",
